        "Description": "47, there&apos;s been some activity on old ICA comms lines. It appears that a team of veteran intelligence and espionage specialists have commandeered the ICAs data core in Chongqing and are attempting to wipe the database of all information pertaining to The Harmonium. \r\rThis is the same team that has made all of our intelligence operations so difficult; they are each individually highly skilled, and leaving a single one alive would be catastrophic.\r\rEliminate the targets.",
